{"id":73209732617463,"type":"artist","name":"Dionne Warwick","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":84,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dionne_Warwick_2021.jpg?width=500","bio":"Dionne Warwick (East Orange, (New Jersey, 12 de diciembre de 1940), cuyo nombre real es Marie Dionne Warrick, es una cantante estadounidense de soul y pop.\n\nSu trabajo más elogiado es el realizado con los compositores Hal David y Burt Bacharach.\n\nSe inició en la música como cantante gospel con su familia. Su debut en solitario de la mano de Bacharach en 1962 interpretando el tema \"Don't Make Me Over\", apareció por un error de imprenta a nombre de Warwick, apellido que conservaría a lo largo de su carrera.","tags":["soul","female vocalists","pop","60s","oldies"]},"works":[{"id":5513657154759,"type":"work","name":"Don’t Make Me Over","artist":"Dionne Warwick","year":1962,"weight":6,"yt":"dDblF-J6qvY","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"1966","title":"1966: The Year the Decade Exploded (Jon Savage)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":2229033237715,"type":"album","name":"Presenting Dionne Warwick","artist":"Dionne Warwick","year":1963,"weight":3,"yt":"PSXpKMmEBXg","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":106824060559178,"name":"RYM Top — R&B — Pop Soul","rank":51,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":187789686998627,"type":"work","name":"A House Is Not a Home","artist":"Dionne Warwick","year":1964,"weight":6,"yt":"Mk7CNHHIuH4","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"1966","title":"1966: The Year the Decade Exploded (Jon Savage)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":195811039403212,"type":"album","name":"Anyone Who Had a Heart","artist":"Dionne Warwick","year":1964,"weight":5,"yt":"e6bTgxVI6XU","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":258468824921983,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Brill Building","rank":5,"scaruffi":null},{"id":106824060559178,"name":"RYM Top — R&B — Pop Soul","rank":86,"scaruff